sequenceDiagram
participant Client
participant Synthesizer
participant Logger

Client ->> Synthesizer: Check IsReady
    alt Not Ready
Synthesizer ->> Logger: LogError Speech synthesizer is not ready
Synthesizer ->> Client: Return false
    else Ready
Synthesizer ->> Synthesizer: GetInstalledVoices
Synthesizer ->> Synthesizer: Filter Enabled Voices
Synthesizer ->> Synthesizer: Map to VoiceInfo
Synthesizer ->> Synthesizer: Return Voices List

Synthesizer ->> Synthesizer: Find Voice by Name
    alt Voice Found
Synthesizer ->> Synthesizer: SelectVoice
Synthesizer ->> Logger: LogInformation Voice set to VoiceName
Synthesizer ->> Client: Return true
    else Voice Not Found
Synthesizer ->> Logger: LogWarning Voice not found
Synthesizer ->> Client: Return false
    end
    end
opt Exception Thrown
Synthesizer ->> Logger: LogError Error setting voice
Synthesizer ->> Client: Return false
    end